                    1031.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The employer upon notice to the Union, agrees to institute a hiring freeze for the classifications, or work types affected by the transfer or removal, as well as for Grade I selling positions, in an effort to create and/or keep for the affected employees, as many available open positions as possible.",
